b559ee4a4192f2b48cb804d957890/ss_7eb6473010ab559ee4a4192f2b48cb804d957890.1920x1080.jpg?t=1746712554","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111870/7eb6473010ab559ee4a4192f2b48cb804d957890/ss_7eb6473010ab559ee4a4192f2b48cb804d957890.600x338.jpg?t=1746712554"}],"short_description":"Unravel a thrilling sci-fi mystery in this action-packed twin-stick roguelite shooter. Select your load-out, stack up temporary and persistent upgrades, and delve into the depths of a subterranean base, either alone or in a group of up to 3 players.","steam_appid":2111870,"support_info":{"email":"contact@oceandrive.studio","url":"https://www.oceandrive.studio"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, Korean, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Japanese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://www.oceandrive.studio"}